        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O?Connell Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this exceptional four-bedroom detached residence, superbly positioned on a private and mature c. 0.5-acre site just off the N20 Cork?Limerick Road.\n\nA home of quality, character and distinction, this impressive property has been finished and maintained to an exceptional standard throughout. Offering an excellent combination of comfort, energy efficiency and practical family living, the residence enjoys an enviable countryside setting while remaining conveniently located within easy reach of Mallow and the N20.\n\nSet amidst beautifully maintained, mature landscaped gardens, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and seclusion. The generous grounds provide an abundance of outdoor space, ideal for family enjoyment, entertaining or simply relaxing and appreciating the peaceful surroundings. The mature planting and established gardens further enhance the attractive setting and create a truly inviting approach to the residence.\n\nInternally, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to provide a well-balanced and highly functional layout ideally suited to modern family life. Bright and generously proportioned rooms create an excellent sense of space and flow throughout, with the living and bedroom accommodation arranged to maximise both comfort and natural light.\n\nThe overall presentation is a testament to the care and attention afforded to the property by its current owners, resulting in a beautifully maintained family home that is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, exceptional privacy and a superb location, this outstanding residence represents a rare opportunity to acquire a quality family home in a peaceful countryside setting with excellent accessibility.\n\nKey Features\nExceptional four-bedroom detached family residence\nBeautifully maintained and presented to a high standard throughout\nPrivate and mature c. 0.5-acre site\nAttractive landscaped gardens offering excellent privacy and seclusion\nBright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation\nThoughtfully designed layout ideal for modern family living\nExcellent balance of countryside living and convenient accessibility\nIdeally positioned just off the N20 Cork?Limerick Road"
